  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1. Overtime is generally paid at **time-and-a-half** under standard U.S. rules.  \n2. “Time-and-a-half” means multiplying the regular hourly rate by \\(1.5\\).  \n3. Mark’s previous wage of \\$11/hour does not change the multiplier.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1.5\\times}\n\\]\n\nThis applies if the weekend hours qualify as overtime; weekend work by itself does not automatically qualify.",
